<title>POLAND: Polish Chemiskor plans 1-to-2 share split.</title>
<headline>Polish Chemiskor plans 1-to-2 share split.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish leather company Chemiskor plans a one-to-two share split of its 1.5 million shares which will produce three million shares of nominal value of one zloty each on April 17, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
